/**
 * PAY-PMT-001 governed payment lifecycle runtime.
 *
 * This service turns current, approved PAY-CORE results into immutable payment
 * intent custody, governs maker/checker release, binds a declarative PAY-CTRY
 * bank-file renderer, records transmission evidence, forward-only failures and
 * reissues, and independently reconciles settlement.  It never reads raw bank
 * secrets, executes legacy bank transactions, posts GL, opens network sockets, or
 * executes country-pack PHP callbacks.
 */
